{
	"name": "Explosive Blast",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By overloading your weapon in a particularly foolish manner, you may expend all of the ammunition in a devastating blast. As an action, you overload your weapon with an additional three rounds of ammunition’s worth of resources before firing. This creates a 20ft cone of explosive force which deals damage equal to three successful attacks to all creatures in the cone and pushes them back 10ft. A successful Dexterity saving throw halves the damage and reduces the distance they’re pushed to 5ft. You take damage from this attack as if you succeeded the saving throw. Using this maneuver destroys your weapon.</p>",
